  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A right circular cylinder has a volume of <math alttext=\"432\"><mn>432</mn>\n</math> cubic centimeters. The area of the base of the cylinder is <math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math> square centimeters. What is the height, in centimeters, of the cylinder?</p>",
